        "metadata": {
          "category": "stories",
          "media": {
            "duration": 586,
            "fileSize": 9534668
          },
          "author": "Neil Gaiman",
          "description": "A New York Times bestselling picture book from Newbery Medal–winning author Neil Gaiman and acclaimed illustrator Adam Rex!  \n\nChu is a little panda with a big sneeze. When Chu sneezes, bad things happen. But as Chu and his parents visit the library, the diner, and the circus, will anyone hear Chu when he starts to feel a familiar tickle in his nose?  \n\nChu's Day is a story that reflects upon how young children aren't always listened to…sometimes to calamitous effect.",
